  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mt. Rwenzori Coffee Processing and Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Crops Coffee.Beneficiaries: 1,631 smallholder farmers of whom 765 are women...Project funds will be used to pay for infrastructural development with construction of a central warehouse and processing facility, procurement of equipment including a truck and motorcycles for use in moving product and extension work respectively, conducting various trainings, provision of working capital for crop finance and farm inputs. Some of the funds will be used to build the Unions technical and managerial capacity as well as for installation of IT equipment and financial systems. .</narrative>
  </description>
